vibecoder (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add consistent local backups, staged restore and recovery barriers.
  * Add conservative pre-migration package upgrade backup and schema checks.
  * Support Pydantic 1.10 and HTTPX 0.26 as shipped by Ubuntu 24.04.
  * Preserve service ownership when restoring staged data.
  * Validate Debian sid and publish the Debian-first support policy.
  * Document historical downgrade recovery and experimental Ubuntu status.

 -- Tobias Diaz <tobias.diaz@uclm.es>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

vibecoder (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package for the persistent supervisor runtime.
  * Add the secure vibecoder-admin command and credential store.
  * Add non-secret debconf bootstrap and resumable first-run initialization.

 -- Tobias Diaz <tobias.diaz@uclm.es>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:00:00 +0100
